wine-sg (10.0-9) unstable; urgency=medium

  * AppX/MSIX: appxpackaging.dll package reader with block-map enforcement
    (0035), package name functions in kernelbase (0034), the AppX signature
    SIP in wintrust (0037). winget's community source now opens.
  * Compression API (MSZIP) in cabinet.dll (0036): winget show works.
  * Security: Authenticode no longer skips the chain for SHA-256 signers
    (0039); a partial chain fails the base policy (0040).
  * crypt32: application policies extension (0041); administrator-added
    root CAs survive the host root sync (0042).
  * wintrust opens verified files with FILE_SHARE_DELETE (0038).

 -- Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>  Wed, 23 Sep 2026 23:54:35 -0700

wine-sg (10.0-8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Windows.ApplicationModel.Resources.ResourceLoader over a new PRI
    (resources.pri) reader (patch 0032): MRT-localised programs show their
    text instead of resource keys -- winget's help, tables and messages.
  * Windows.Foundation.Uri parsed with urlmon's IUri (patch 0033): host,
    path, query, port, CombineUri and the rest instead of E_NOTIMPL.

